1
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,120
Witch!

2
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,439
They've come to cause a scene!

3
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:19,239
Let's just call it off tonight.

4
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,799
Let's not bury Mengzhu just yet.

5
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:35,680
My lord

6
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,519
What's that noise?

7
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,439
It's... it's a Reanimated corpse!

8
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:46,200
A Reanimated corpse!

9
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,680
Mengzhu's a Reanimated corpse!

10
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:51,840
She's coming out!

11
00:02:07,079 --> 00:02:07,640
How dare you!

12
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:09,360
Step back, all of you.

13
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:20,639
Isn't this Chief Mu's daughter, Mu Ying?

14
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:21,960
I haven't seen you in years.

15
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,400
You've grown even more beautiful.

16
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:24,639
Benefactor Li.

17
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:28,319
Chief Mu and I are very close...

18
00:02:29,479 --> 00:02:30,240
...friends.

19
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,159
Don't mention him to me.

20
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,599
He's him, and I'm me.

21
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:34,120
This is feudal superstition!

22
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:35,000
Human sacrifice is against the law!

23
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:35,599
Inspector Mu.

24
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:37,840
What?

25
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:39,280
Master!

26
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,400
Master!

27
00:02:41,919 --> 00:02:43,439
Master, I'm too late!

28
00:02:43,639 --> 00:02:44,439
Master!

29
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,319
Stop crying.

30
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,479
Let's lift him out first.

31
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,240
Master!

32
00:02:53,759 --> 00:02:55,120
He's not breathing.

33
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,840
Master, you can't die!

34
00:02:57,919 --> 00:03:00,439
You haven't taken me to Drunken Sage Pavilion for roast chicken yet!

35
00:03:00,639 --> 00:03:01,759
Master!

36
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:02,680
Master!

37
00:03:03,639 --> 00:03:04,280
What are you doing?

38
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:06,919
Master!

39
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,439
Master!

40
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,039
Who hit me?

41
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:10,800
She did.

42
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:12,439
She-devil!

43
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:14,360
You hit way too hard!

44
00:03:14,639 --> 00:03:15,719
Well, you aren't dead, are you?

45
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,159
You just fainted from lack of oxygen.

46
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,120
What do you mean, not dead?

47
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:20,240
She almost strangled me, you know!

48
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:22,039
Have you been reading too many storybooks?

49
00:03:22,199 --> 00:03:24,199
This is acute cerebral hypoxia...

50
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,639
...causing hallucinations.

51
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,199
You were lying in that coffin for so long...

52
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,120
...with poor air circulation,

53
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,080
...leading to hypoxia,

54
00:03:31,479 --> 00:03:33,840
...which disrupted your nerve signals.

55
00:03:34,879 --> 00:03:36,159
And you claim Mengzhu tried to kill you?

56
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,000
She's already dead.

57
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:37,919
How could she kill you?

58
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,199
Master!

59
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:47,639
It...

60
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,520
It came back.

61
00:03:53,479 --> 00:03:53,879
This...

62
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:56,319
This puppet has an Evil aura.

63
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,560
Every time someone dies in the Li mansion,

64
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:00,599
it appears.

65
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:02,599
No matter how far we throw it,

66
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,439
it's no use.

67
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:16,879
Madam...

68
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:44,839
First Madam, Second Madam...

69
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,360
after Third Madam died,

70
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:49,560
this little wooden puppet appeared beside their bodies.

71
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:51,519
I remember it with absolute certainty.

72
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,839
We destroyed this evil thing every time.

73
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:54,920
But...

74
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:56,120
it wouldn't take long

75
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,560
for this wooden puppet...

76
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,319
to just come back on its own.

77
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:00,480
This wooden puppet...

78
00:05:01,279 --> 00:05:02,120
It has an Evil aura.

79
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,000
It can steal souls.

80
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:07,480
A broken wooden puppet stealing souls?

81
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:08,720
What a joke.

82
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:10,759
Where's the book?

83
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,720
Where did that book, Heavenly Craftsmanship, go?

84
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:15,879
Benefactor Li.

85
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,759
You're suspected of kidnapping and attempted murder.

86
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:19,720
Come back to the station with me.

87
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,759
I'm innocent, Inspector Mu!

88
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,360
I...

89
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:24,519
She...

90
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,079
It was all her doing!

91
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,480
I was only thinking of Master Li.

92
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:31,319
To quell the bloody disaster in the Li mansion,

93
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:34,199
we must let the dead fulfill their dying wishes.

94
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:36,920
Otherwise, the disasters in the Li mansion will never end!

95
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,439
I need to find a way to stay at the Li mansion,

96
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:39,920
to get Heavenly Craftsmanship back.

97
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:40,759
All right.

98
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:42,720
I'm not dead yet, am I?

99
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:43,720
I think...

100
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,879
we should investigate the cause of

101
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,160
Mengzhu's death first,

102
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:48,959
before talking about arresting anyone.

103
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,639
What?

104
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,920
You want to write Mengzhu's case into a storybook

105
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:54,879
and have your apprentice tell stories in restaurants?

106
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,120
My Master is highly learned.

107
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:01,160
And this She-devil...

108
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,199
is highly skilled in martial arts.

109
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,199
With the two of them joining forces,

110
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,600
they can definitely solve this case.

111
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:07,920
I heard Mengzhu say

112
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:09,600
your mansion has great food for guests.

113
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:11,959
Now I'll give you a chance to make up for your mistakes.

114
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:12,959
Maybe

115
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:14,600
my Master will forgive you.

116
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,279
Yes, yes, yes.

117
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,600
Chunmei!

118
00:06:20,199 --> 00:06:21,360
Hurry and inform the kitchen

119
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:23,480
to prepare good wine and dishes!

120
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,800
Yes, Master.

121
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,040
Why does he look like a beggar?

122
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,600
All he does is eat all day.

123
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,680
Don't we have to eat before we work?

124
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,000
How did Mengzhu actually die?

125
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,439
Mengzhu died under mysterious circumstances.

126
00:06:46,279 --> 00:06:47,560
We were in a hurry to bury her

127
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:48,959
because we're afraid that Mengzhu,

128
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,560
like those three concubines,

129
00:06:50,759 --> 00:06:51,600
will become a Vengeful spirit

130
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:54,519
and haunt the mansion every night!

131
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:56,319
Since she died under mysterious circumstances,

132
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,079
I have to investigate it thoroughly.

133
00:06:59,480 --> 00:06:59,920
Step aside.

134
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:00,560
I'll perform the autopsy.

135
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:14,480
I didn't know you could perform autopsies.

136
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:21,519
This is...

137
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,240
A needle mark on the victim's neck.

138
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,000
The head sustained a blow,

139
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,680
causing a skull fracture.

140
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,040
The fracture caused internal bleeding.

141
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,319
So,

142
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,279
Mengzhu's cause of death

143
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,680
was a skull fracture

144
00:07:39,839 --> 00:07:41,240
and excessive blood loss.

145
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:45,360
This needle is highly suspicious.

146
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:46,680
A needle?

147
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:48,839
Where did it come from?

148
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,560
Master,

149
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,360
did someone break in

150
00:07:53,079 --> 00:07:53,759
and kill her?

151
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,079
That's impossible.

152
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:59,000
The Li estate is guarded every night.

153
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,560
No outsider could possibly get in.

154
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:02,600
Who was Mengzhu with before she died?

155
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:03,680
Well...

156
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:05,879
Chunmei!

157
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,319
Chunmei!

158
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,519
I'm here, Master!

159
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,839
Before Mengzhu died,

160
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,279
who else did she meet?

161
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:16,360
After dinner that day,

162
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,399
Miss heard two storytellers came to town,

163
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,399
so she took me to the restaurant.

164
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,720
We've met.

165
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:25,279
And we spoke with Miss Mengzhu.

166
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:26,879
But what about later?

167
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:28,920
Miss was upset that you ignored her,

168
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,560
so she took me to the temple fair.

169
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,120
She bought a whole bunch of things.

170
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,000
Take a look, miss.

171
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:34,919
It's so pretty.

172
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,600
It's beautiful.

173
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:37,320
This umbrella is lovely.

174
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:38,639
Right?

175
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:40,960
How much is this?

176
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:44,120
Miss! Miss!

177
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,000
Come take a look!

178
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:49,639
Then we headed back after dark.

179
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:51,840
Late that night,

180
00:08:52,759 --> 00:08:55,080
stray cats kept Mengzhu awake,

181
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:56,840
so she insisted on swapping rooms with me.

182
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:58,960
I never expected that the next morning,

183
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,759
I'd find Mengzhu already dead.

184
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:02,720
What about this needle?

185
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:03,559
Where did it go?

186
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,440
What needle?

187
00:09:04,559 --> 00:09:05,679
I didn't see any needle.

188
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,679
Mengzhu was clearly murdered!

189
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:08,960
Why didn't you call the police,

190
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,519
instead of tying him up for a ghost marriage?

191
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:14,759
When the previous three wives died,

192
00:09:15,159 --> 00:09:16,279
we did report it to the police.

193
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,600
But the police found nothing at all.

194
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,320
If we had to rely on you police,

195
00:09:21,039 --> 00:09:22,200
we'd be better off on our own.

196
00:09:22,919 --> 00:09:23,360
I...

197
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,360
Master Li,

198
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:25,919
could you please

199
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:28,039
take us to Mengzhu's room

200
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:28,759
to have another look?

201
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:59,200
Early that morning,

202
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,240
when my daughter was found,

203
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:02,919
her body was lying right here.

204
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,240
What exactly happened?

205
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,200
Did you see the killer?

206
00:11:02,559 --> 00:11:03,759
After Mengzhu was hit by the needle,

207
00:11:04,879 --> 00:11:05,960
she fell off the bed.

208
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:09,360
She hit her head on this cabinet,

209
00:11:10,279 --> 00:11:11,600
which caused the skull fracture.

210
00:11:12,399 --> 00:11:13,720
There's no murder weapon in the room,

211
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:15,960
and the killer left no traces.

212
00:11:16,879 --> 00:11:17,960
Where did the needle come from?

213
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,720
Why is there an extra table here?

214
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:22,240
It wasn't here before.

215
00:11:30,679 --> 00:11:31,799
This Zhong Kui wood carving...

216
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,519
my daughter bought it specifically for me to ward off evil.

217
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:43,639
The wooden puppet is wet.

218
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,360
There's a small hole in the roof.

219
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,720
There really is a small hole.

220
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:52,240
Bookworm,

221
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:53,399
how did you know?

222
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,039
The Li residence has always been well-maintained.

223
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:58,879
How could there be a hole?

224
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,159
This wooden puppet...

225
00:12:02,559 --> 00:12:03,559
was rigged with a hidden weapon.

226
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:07,399
It rained heavily the night of the incident.

227
00:12:08,399 --> 00:12:09,840
Someone removed the roof tiles,

228
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,440
creating a puddle.

229
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:15,360
I don't care. I'm switching rooms with you.

230
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:16,120
Dad!

231
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,240
Alright, alright.

232
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:17,840
Fine.

233
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,279
Oh, you.

234
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,759
A hole was chiseled in the roof,

235
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:26,639
so the water leaked through,

236
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:28,960
dripping right onto the wooden puppet.

237
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:44,480
The rainwater triggered the hidden weapon in the puppet.

238
00:12:45,679 --> 00:12:46,679
The weapon fired a silver needle.

239
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,200
Mengzhu was struck by the silver needle,

240
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,000
crashed into the cabinet,

241
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,519
and died from a skull fracture.

242
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:53,759
So,

243
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,080
the accumulated water

244
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,120
was what really caused the puppet to kill.

245
00:12:59,279 --> 00:13:01,039
Using rainwater and a puppet

246
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,720
to commit a locked-room murder.

247
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:03,679
Exactly.

248
00:13:04,879 --> 00:13:06,039
Then what's the motive?

249
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,159
Right.

250
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,120
Mengzhu was a wealthy young lady.

251
00:13:09,679 --> 00:13:10,960
Why would anyone kill her?

252
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,559
This room

253
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,360
was originally Master Li's bedroom.

254
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:21,480
Mengzhu swapped rooms with Master Li.

255
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:23,320
Therefore,

256
00:13:24,679 --> 00:13:26,200
the killer's real target

257
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,320
must have been Master Li.

258
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,159
Someone is trying to kill me.
